    {
      "name": "fetch_nth_release",
      "title": "Fetch nth release",
      "description": "Fetch the nth release of series (0=first/initial release, 1=first revision, etc.).\n\nIf unsure of Macrobond's usage rules, call get_instructions() first.\n\nUseful for constructing real-time datasets using only initially-released values.\n\nCall with confirm=false first to preview (fetches nothing); after the user's\nexplicit confirmation, re-call with confirm=true and the returned invocation_token.\n\nResults are paginated: `limit` series per page (default 20), selected by `page`\n(1-based). Read `total_pages` / `has_next`. Pages after the first are served\nfrom the cached result — no new confirmation or quota cost.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "names": {
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "minItems": 1,
            "type": "array",
            "description": "Series names to fetch."
          },
          "nth": {
            "minimum": 0,
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "Release number (0=first release, 1=first revision, 2=second revision, ...)."
          },
          "confirm": {
            "default": false,
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "False (default) returns a preview without fetching. True performs the fetch."
          },
          "invocation_token": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "default": null,
            "description": "Required when confirm=true. Must match the token returned by the preview call."
          },
          "get_times_of_change": {
            "default": false,
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "Include when each value was released."
          },
          "date_end_of_period": {
            "default": false,
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "Return dates at end of period instead of start."
          },
          "limit": {
            "default": 20,
            "minimum": 1,
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "Series per page (min 1, default 20)."
          },
          "page": {
            "default": 1,
            "minimum": 1,
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "1-based page number over the fetched series."
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "names",
          "nth"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "annotations": {
        "readOnlyHint": false,
        "destructiveHint": false,
        "idempotentHint": false,
        "openWorldHint": true
      },
      "_meta": {
        "fastmcp": {
          "tags": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "fetch_observation_history",
      "title": "Fetch observation history",
      "description": "Get the revision history for specific observation dates within a series.\n\nIf unsure of Macrobond's usage rules, call get_instructions() first.\n\nShows how the value for each date changed across successive data releases.\n\nCall with confirm=false first to preview (fetches nothing); after the user's\nexplicit confirmation, re-call with confirm=true and the returned invocation_token.\n\nResults are paginated over the observations: `limit` per page (default 20),\nselected by `page` (1-based). Read `total_pages` / `has_next`. Pages after\nthe first are served from the cached result — no new confirmation or quota cost.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Series name."
          },
          "observation_dates": {
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "minItems": 1,
            "type": "array",
            "description": "ISO observation dates, e.g. [\"2023-10-01T00:00:00Z\"]."
          },
          "confirm": {
            "default": false,
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "False (default) returns a preview without fetching. True performs the fetch."
          },
          "invocation_token": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "default": null,
            "description": "Required when confirm=true. Must match the token returned by the preview call."
          },
          "limit": {
            "default": 20,
            "minimum": 1,
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "Observations per page (min 1, default 20)."
          },
          "page": {
            "default": 1,
            "minimum": 1,
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "1-based page number over the fetched observations."
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "name",
          "observation_dates"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "annotations": {
        "readOnlyHint": false,
        "destructiveHint": false,
        "idempotentHint": false,
        "openWorldHint": true
      },
      "_meta": {
        "fastmcp": {
          "tags": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "fetch_series",
      "title": "Fetch series",
      "description": "Fetch time series data (dates and values) for one or more series by name.\n\nIf unsure of Macrobond's usage rules, call get_instructions() first.\n\nCall with confirm=false first to preview (fetches nothing); after the user's\nexplicit confirmation, re-call with confirm=true and the returned invocation_token.\n\nResults are paginated: the confirmed fetch retrieves every requested series\nonce, then hands back `limit` series per page (default 20). Read `total_pages`\n/ `has_next` and request later pages with `page` (1-based). Pages after the\nfirst are served from the cached result — no new confirmation or quota cost.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "names": {
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "minItems": 1,
            "type": "array",
            "description": "Series names to fetch."
          },
          "start_date": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "default": null,
            "description": "Start of date range. Accepts ISO date (\"2020-01-01\") or relative\noffsets (\"-1y\", \"-6m\", \"-30d\", \"-4q\"). Defaults to one year before today."
          },
          "end_date": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "default": null,
            "description": "End of date range. Same format as start_date. Defaults to today."
          },
          "confirm": {
            "default": false,
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "False (default) returns a preview without fetching. True performs the fetch."
          },
          "invocation_token": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "default": null,
            "description": "Required when confirm=true. Must match the token returned by the preview call."
          },
          "date_end_of_period": {
            "default": false,
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "Return dates at end of period instead of start."
          },
          "limit": {
            "default": 20,
            "minimum": 1,
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "Series per page (min 1, default 20)."
          },
          "page": {
            "default": 1,
            "minimum": 1,
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "1-based page number over the fetched series."
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "names"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "outputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "annotations": {
        "readOnlyHint": false,
        "destructiveHint": false,
        "idempotentHint": false,
        "openWorldHint": true
      },
      "_meta": {
        "fastmcp": {
          "tags": []
        }
      }
    },
